{"id":"NCT05198661","title":"Paraneoplastic Neurological Syndromes and Autoimmune Encephalitis Collection","official":"Paraneoplastic Neurological Syndromes and Autoimmune Encephalitis Collection","summary":"Numerous neurological disorders affecting the central and peripheral nervous system can be attributed to the immune system through multiple effector mechanisms. However, current treatments could be drastically improved by faster and more accurate diagnosis. The sample collection will benefit to patients with rare neuroimmune syndromes such as Autoimmune Encephalitis (AE) and Paraneoplastic Neurological Syndromes (PNS) leading to a better and early diagnosis, as well as treatment improvement.","conditions":["Paraneoplastic Neurological Syndromes or Autoimmune Encephalitis"],"interventions":[{"type":"BIOLOGICAL","name":"Collection of biological sample with sera, CSF, buffy coat, PBMC, plasma."}],"criteria":"Inclusion Criteria:\n\n* Patient with consent\n* Patient with well-characterized antibodies in serum or cerebrospinal fluid or not\n* Patient with neurological disorder compatible with PNS or auto-immune encephalitis\n\nExclusion Criteria:\n\n* Refusal of consent\n* Patient under guardianship","minAge":"","maxAge":"","sex":"ALL","healthy":false,"studyType":"INTERVENTIONAL","purpose":"OTHER","enrollment":3500,"start":"2022-08-02","pcd":"2032-08-02","upd":"2024-02-29","sponsor":"Hospices Civils de Lyon","areas":["neurology","oncology","rare"],"central":["Jerome HONNORAT, Pr · 4 72 35 78 06 ext. +33 · jerome.honnorat@chu-lyon.fr","Geraldine PICARD · 4 72 35 58 42 ext. +33 · geraldine.picard@chu-lyon.fr"],"sites":[{"f":"Neurology","city":"Pointe à Pitre","pr":"","zip":"97159","s":"NYR","lat":44.0798,"lon":1.9894,"c":"Hugo CHAUMONT, MD · 5 90 89 14 30 ext. 590 · hugo.chaumont@chu-guadeloupe.fr"},{"f":"Neurology","city":"Aix-en-Provence","pr":"","zip":"13616","s":"NYR","lat":43.5283,"lon":5.4497,"c":"Laurent MARTINEZ ALMOYNA, MD · 04 42 33 50 71 ext. +33 · lmartineza